<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks continue in the southern insurgency zone, with a grenade blast reported in Trang and pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala. Cambodia protests Thai military road construction in Oddar Meanchey and disputes over three border temples persist, while a Cambodian film on the 1979 refugee crisis has sparked controversy in Thailand. The Thai government is introducing digital border passes to speed queues at the Mae Sai crossing, and the central banks of Singapore, Malaysia and Thailand have joined the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE16SVJJNUNZRm1IZGhXR3RzUGxpQkdmM2E5SUd6a0JPVHpiTWFtZ3ZzT1BsNUdjS3ZzN3YyQXcxOThMX1czLWdqY0xUQ2FISXB4R0tRZGt6aU1EVllGVG5qeWc4UEJyZGY1MUdLWFBSaHJZZ3MzZWFYaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;IOL&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQeU9NVDNPck5CdTJMY3VkeHRpeHNGbnZYOTU4VlBlalZGS2RkN1JEN0FFV2l2WjNibkxZN1J6c0RwRkdXWldOT3BJRU5JVjNLTU1FUGtveTJad0NxT3dUSmRPSV8tWUJCXzE3RXBWek5IT2RCVFRyVHRzUk9mTUxjTjBfZ3A5Y08yY3VXd2FsWXhDYXV0Vmd6SjNOcE5mMjlPb0Z4T0EyR0h1ejd2LVp2UDNCb2J3dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE9tMTlVNzlmOEI2RlRxMFhjbWlnM3ItSmZpbTNfNEdid2tNQ0NvczQzSzJRQjgzLXdBZEVrSjFCLWVOa2N2cWM0cnFYVzU5UVZyd3NrMnhBa1VVNXFiM05z?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTFBtWlJuTmhJSXRmTVM1MmZNelp0QlpZLTZqUmxqTHRIcjRKUGo3by1rZ2p0NnpQbXI2dnRfbGxuNlhXZnNFS2xJU01MNVVFTkJmRzR5Y0tDTEt6M0VkN3BCbUFR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://